    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relax Scramble</strong> is a cozy, endless word puzzle game designed for calm minds and clever players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no time limits, no pressure \u2014 just a soothing flow of falling letters. Select and combine them into words, earn points, and watch the board gently refill itself with new possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're looking to unwind after a long day or gently train your vocabulary, Relax Scramble offers a minimal, meditative experience where progress is as slow or fast as you like.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3f Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <i>Endless gameplay</i> \u2014 no game over, just pure word crafting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u270d\ufe0f <i>Build words freely</i> from a grid of shifting letters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 <i>Relaxing music and sound design</i> for a cozy atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <i>Great for all ages and skill levels</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbe <i>Cloud saves</i> to keep your progress across devices</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love games like Wordament, SpellTower, or Letter Quest \u2014 but always wished they were more relaxing \u2014 this is your perfect escape.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relax Scramble</strong> is a cozy, endless word puzzle game designed for calm minds and clever players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no time limits, no pressure \u2014 just a soothing flow of falling letters. Select and combine them into words, earn points, and watch the board gently refill itself with new possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're looking to unwind after a long day or gently train your vocabulary, Relax Scramble offers a minimal, meditative experience where progress is as slow or fast as you like.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3f Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <i>Endless gameplay</i> \u2014 no game over, just pure word crafting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u270d\ufe0f <i>Build words freely</i> from a grid of shifting letters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 <i>Relaxing music and sound design</i> for a cozy atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <i>Great for all ages and skill levels</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbe <i>Cloud saves</i> to keep your progress across devices</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love games like Wordament, SpellTower, or Letter Quest \u2014 but always wished they were more relaxing \u2014 this is your perfect escape.</p>",
